---
import CaseContents from "./CaseContents.astro";
---
<article class="mvc-case">
  <header class="mvc-intro">
    <div class="mvc-intro__meta case-meta"><span class="case-meta__client-full">Marriott International</span><span class="case-meta__client-short">Marriott</span><span class="case-meta__highlight">4 brands unified</span></div>
    <div class="mvc-intro__grid">
      <div><p>Navigation &amp; shared design patterns</p><h1>Vacation,<br />made clear.</h1></div>
      <div class="mvc-intro__summary"><p>Twelve business-led categories became three member tasks across four brands.</p><dl><div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Lead UX Brand Strategist and UX Designer</dd></div><div><dt>Scope</dt><dd>Research, IA, design systems</dd></div></dl></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <CaseContents links={[{"href": "#case-section-1", "label": "The problem"}, {"href": "#case-section-2", "label": "The shift"}, {"href": "#case-section-3", "label": "The system"}, {"href": "#case-section-4", "label": "Four brands"}, {"href": "#case-section-5", "label": "Outcome"}]} />

  <figure class="mvc-hero"><img src="/images/marriott_hero.webp" alt="Marriott Vacation Club experience on a mobile phone beside a pool" loading="eager" /></figure>

  <section class="mvc-problem" id="case-section-1" tabindex="-1">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">01 / The problem</p><h2>A platform built<br />for the business.</h2></div>
    <div class="mvc-problem__copy"><p>Through Pocket Made, I led a multi-year ChrowmDesigns engagement as Lead UX Brand Strategist and UX Designer, working with internal teams on information architecture, mobile design, and shared patterns.</p><p>Twelve navigation categories reflected business units, leaving new bookers and experienced owners to decode the same structure.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="mvc-context" aria-labelledby="mvc-discovery-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Research &amp; discovery</p><h2 id="mvc-discovery-title">Different members.<br />Different questions.</h2></div>
    <div><p>Heuristic audits, behavioral analytics, and stakeholder workshops examined friction and whether business measures reflected member needs.</p><p>Testing with prospects, first-year members, and established owners made benefit clarity the priority: understanding the offer, using membership, and managing borrowing, expiration, or waitlists.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="mvc-research"><figure class="mvc-research__map"><img src="/images/marriott01.webp" alt="Complex Marriott journey map and waitlist process" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="mvc-research__side"><figure><img src="/images/marriott02.webp" alt="Vacation destination beside an infinity pool" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img src="/images/marriott03.webp" alt="Journey-mapping workshop artifacts" loading="lazy" /></figure></div></section>

  <section class="mvc-shift" id="case-section-2" tabindex="-1">
    <p class="eyebrow">02 / The shift</p><h2>12 categories<br /><span>→</span> 3 intentions.</h2><div class="mvc-shift__paths"><div><b>01</b><strong>Explore destinations</strong><p>Find the place and experience that fits.</p></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Manage membership</strong><p>Understand benefits, points, and ownership.</p></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Book your stay</strong><p>Move confidently from intent to reservation.</p></div></div>
    <div class="mvc-shift__reason"><p>I organized navigation around Explore Destinations, Manage Membership, and Book Your Stay to give each intention a direct entry.</p><p>Shared patterns connected native apps and web, while a five-year roadmap co-authored with senior stakeholders connected the navigation changes to product direction.</p></div>
  </section>

  <figure class="mvc-system-hero"><img src="/images/marriott06.webp" alt="Marriott Vacation Club desktop experience" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <section class="mvc-system" id="case-section-3" tabindex="-1"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / The system</p><h2>Show the detail<br />when it is needed.</h2></div><div><p>Cards revealed ownership rules when needed, keeping first-time booking focused while retaining detail for experienced owners.</p><p>Mobile requirements covered one-handed use, larger targets, contrast, and readability, informed by WCAG 2.1 AA.</p></div></section>
  <section class="mvc-devices"><figure><img src="/images/marriott04.webp" alt="Marriott mobile campaign shown on a phone" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img src="/images/marriott05.webp" alt="Marriott travel campaign shown on a phone" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img src="/images/marriott07.webp" alt="Marriott membership campaign shown on a phone" loading="lazy" /></figure></section>

  <section class="mvc-scale" id="case-section-4" tabindex="-1"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Four brands, one foundation</p><h2>Shared patterns.<br />Room for each brand.</h2></div><figure><img src="/images/marriott10.webp" alt="Marriott Vacation Club responsive web design system" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="mvc-scale__copy"><p>The framework covered Marriott Vacation Club, Hyatt, Sheraton, and ILG, preserving each team's brand treatment within shared interactions.</p><p>Training, handoff guidance, and governance defined how teams could use, extend, and adapt the components.</p></div></section>

  <section class="mvc-outcome" id="case-section-5" tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">05 / Outcome</p><h2>What changed<br />in the design.</h2><p>The design addressed 47 mapped friction points, replaced twelve primary categories with three paths, and established one foundation across four brands. These are changes to the design, not measured booking or comprehension outcomes.</p><div class="mvc-outcome__stats"><div><strong>47</strong><span>mapped friction points addressed</span></div><div><strong>12 → 3</strong><span>primary navigation paths</span></div><div><strong>4</strong><span>brands unified by one system</span></div></div><figure><img src="/images/marriott11.webp" alt="Marriott Vacation Club mobile app experience" loading="lazy" /></figure></section>
  <section class="mvc-context mvc-context--reflection" aria-labelledby="mvc-reflection-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Looking back</p><h2 id="mvc-reflection-title">Follow the decisions<br />over time.</h2></div><div><p>I would extend member research over weeks to follow borrowing and expiration decisions that a single usability session cannot capture.</p><p>That would test whether the guidance remains useful beyond the first visit, particularly for owners with complex portfolios.</p></div></section>
</article>
<style>
 .mvc-case{--ink:#123d3e;--sage:#3e625b;--paper:#f6f4ee;--sand:#dbd3bf;--line:#c6cec6;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif}.mvc-case *{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}.mvc-case figure,.mvc-case p,.mvc-case h1,.mvc-case h2{margin:0}.mvc-case img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.mvc-intro{padding:28px 4vw 90px}.mvc-intro__meta{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;padding-bottom:15px;text-transform:uppercase}.mvc-intro__grid,.mvc-problem,.mvc-system,.mvc-scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:8vw}.mvc-intro__grid{align-items:end;padding-top:76px}.mvc-intro__grid>div:first-child>p,.eyebrow{color:var(--sage);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.mvc-intro h1{font-size:clamp(70px,12vw,190px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.09em;line-height:.78;margin-top:26px}.mvc-intro__summary>p{font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,29px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.25}.mvc-intro dl{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:45px 0 0;padding-top:14px}.mvc-intro dl div{display:flex;gap:16px;font-size:12px;justify-content:space-between;margin:10px 0}.mvc-intro dt{color:var(--sage)}.mvc-intro dd{margin:0;text-align:right}.mvc-hero{height:min(57vw,850px)}.mvc-problem{padding:145px 4vw}.mvc-case h2{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,98px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:.9;margin-top:22px}.mvc-problem__copy,.mvc-system>div:last-child,.mvc-scale__copy{align-self:end;color:#355e5b;display:grid;gap:24px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;max-width:530px}.mvc-research{background:#dfddd5;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;padding:4vw;gap:18px}.mvc-research__map{aspect-ratio:1.46}.mvc-research__side{display:contents}.mvc-research__side figure:first-child{align-self:end;aspect-ratio:.72}.mvc-research__side figure:last-child{aspect-ratio:2.02;grid-column:1/-1}.mvc-research>p{color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(18px,2.3vw,32px);grid-column:1/-1;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:360px}.mvc-shift{background:var(--ink);color:#eff4ed;padding:140px 4vw}.mvc-shift h2{font-size:clamp(60px,11vw,180px);line-height:.76}.mvc-shift h2 span{color:#9ad3c2}.mvc-shift__paths{border-top:1px solid #6c908b;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:100px}.mvc-shift__paths div{border-right:1px solid #6c908b;padding:18px 24px 35px 0}.mvc-shift__paths div+div{padding-left:24px}.mvc-shift__paths b{color:#a4dacd;font-size:12px}.mvc-shift__paths strong{display:block;font-size:27px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:60px}.mvc-shift__paths p{color:#c9d9d1;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:10px;max-width:220px}.mvc-system-hero{aspect-ratio:2.02}.mvc-system{padding:140px 4vw}.mvc-devices{background:#e0e2df;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.46fr .72fr .72fr;gap:18px;padding:4vw}.mvc-devices figure:first-child{aspect-ratio:1.46}.mvc-devices figure:nth-child(2),.mvc-devices figure:nth-child(3){aspect-ratio:.72}.mvc-scale{padding:150px 4vw}.mvc-scale figure{grid-column:1/-1;margin-top:30px}.mvc-scale figure img{aspect-ratio:1.143;object-fit:contain}.mvc-scale__copy{grid-column:2}.mvc-outcome{background:#d4e1dc;padding:130px 4vw 0}.mvc-outcome__stats{border-top:1px solid #9bb9ae;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin:84px 0}.mvc-outcome__stats div{border-right:1px solid #9bb9ae;padding:18px 20px 46px 0}.mvc-outcome__stats div+div{padding-left:20px}.mvc-outcome strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(52px,8vw,125px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.09em;line-height:.8}.mvc-outcome span{display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:18px;max-width:150px}.mvc-outcome figure{aspect-ratio:2.02}@media(max-width:760px){.mvc-intro__grid,.mvc-problem,.mvc-system,.mvc-scale{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.mvc-intro__grid{padding-top:48px}.mvc-problem,.mvc-system,.mvc-scale,.mvc-shift,.mvc-outcome{padding-top:82px;padding-bottom:82px}.mvc-research{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mvc-research__side figure:first-child,.mvc-research__side figure:last-child{grid-column:auto}.mvc-shift__paths,.mvc-devices,.mvc-outcome__stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mvc-shift__paths{margin-top:60px}.mvc-shift__paths div,.mvc-shift__paths div+div{border-bottom:1px solid #6c908b;border-right:0;padding:18px 0 26px}.mvc-shift__paths strong{margin-top:30px}.mvc-scale figure{grid-column:auto}.mvc-scale__copy{grid-column:auto}.mvc-outcome__stats{margin:52px 0}.mvc-outcome__stats div,.mvc-outcome__stats div+div{border-bottom:1px solid #9bb9ae;border-right:0;padding:18px 0 28px}}
.mvc-shift .eyebrow{color:#a4dacd}.mvc-intro__summary>p{color:var(--ink);text-transform:none}.mvc-intro dd{max-width:75%}

.mvc-context{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.3fr);gap:clamp(32px,8vw,120px);padding:64px 4vw;background:#fff;color:#1b1b1b}
.mvc-context h2{font:400 clamp(30px,4vw,60px)/1.08 var(--font-sans);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:20px 0 0}
.mvc-context p:not(.eyebrow),.mvc-shift__reason p{font:400 clamp(16px,1.3vw,17px)/1.6 var(--font-sans)}
.mvc-context p+p,.mvc-shift__reason p+p{margin-top:24px}
.mvc-shift__reason{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-top:48px;max-width:none}.mvc-shift__reason p+p{margin-top:0}
.mvc-context--reflection{border-top:1px solid #ddd}
.mvc-problem__copy p,.mvc-system>div>p:not(.eyebrow),.mvc-scale__copy p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,17px);line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:800px){.mvc-context,.mvc-shift__reason{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.mvc-context{padding-block:40px}}
</style>
